// Per-player capsule: spawned by the server when a client joins, OWNED by that client. The owning
// client drives it with WASD/Space (key C toggles player control — the free-fly camera releases
// those keys; V toggles first/third person), simulating it LOCALLY for full responsiveness; the
// claim stream carries the resulting body state to the server, validated by the Network/Validation
// plausibility gate (move implausibly fast or through geometry and the server rejects +
// force-corrects). Everyone else sees it as a normal replica. LockRotation keeps it upright inside
// the solver on every instance (owner, server twin, replicas).
Prefab netPlayerCapsule
	Scale 0.4
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer wireshapes
		Node Capsule
		Type StaticMesh
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Capsule
		Radius 1
		HalfHeight 1
		Density 120
		Friction 0.3
		Restitution 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Network
